  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Working on new house rules: in quest of a better jaguar - farmer coexistence in the Atlantic Forest..of Argentina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to prevent retaliatory killing of jaguars within the Priority Landscape for Jaguar Protection in the Atlantic Forest. Project activities will develop and implement a surveillance and rapid-response system to address cases of potential or actual jaguar attacks on livestock to avoid and reduce retaliatory killing of jaguars, and establish two pilot livestock farms that adopt production practices that reduce conflicts with jaguars and other large felines and serve as demonstrative units within the Priority Landscape for Jaguar Protection in the Atlantic Forest.</narrative>
  </description>
